# The test harness pins jsdom to an exact version instead of committing a lockfile. One
# dev-only dependency does not justify an 18 KB lockfile in a plugin repository, and a
# breaking change in a transitive dependency would show up as a loud red test job rather
# than as anything shipped to users.
